1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
 All we had to do was see the person God had placed in our path.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:11,000
 Look with compassion rather than judgment and then act.

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:18,000
 Brothers and sisters, let us pray every day for eyes to see the divine appointments God places before us.

4
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:23,000
 Let us put compassion into action and minister to the person in front of us.

5
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:27,000
 It's what Jesus did, and it's what we do.

6
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:36,240
 In the sacred name we take upon ourselves by covenant, even Jesus Christ. Amen.

